    "Figma, FigJam, Miro, Jira, Notion, Webflow, Adobe Creative Cloud y WordPress.": "Figma, FigJam, Miro, Jira, Notion, Webflow, Adobe Creative Cloud, and WordPress.",
    "Diseño de productos digitales para clientes de gobierno, seguros, finanzas, tecnología y organizaciones institucionales, incluyendo plataformas web y mobile, dashboards, centros de monitoreo, backoffice, sistemas ERP, landings y sitios corporativos.": "Digital product design for government, insurance, finance, technology, and institutional clients, including web and mobile platforms, dashboards, monitoring centers, back-office systems, ERP, landing pages, and corporate websites.",
    "Diseñé flujos completos para web, mobile y dashboards, asegurando consistencia visual y funcional entre plataformas.": "Designed end-to-end flows for web, mobile, and dashboards, ensuring visual and functional consistency across platforms.",
    "Participé en procesos de discovery, relevamiento de requerimientos y análisis de objetivos de negocio y necesidades de usuarios.": "Contributed to discovery, requirements gathering, and analysis of business goals and user needs.",
    "Creé y mantuve librerías de componentes reutilizables para unificar criterios de interfaz y agilizar entregas.": "Created and maintained reusable component libraries to align interface decisions and speed up delivery.",
    "Documenté flujos, interacciones, componentes y manuales de uso para facilitar handoff, adopción y soporte operativo.": "Documented flows, interactions, components, and user guides to support handoff, adoption, and operational support.",
    "Coordiné con Product Owners, clientes y equipos de desarrollo para validar soluciones, acompañar implementación y proponer mejoras.": "Collaborated with Product Owners, clients, and development teams to validate solutions, support implementation, and propose improvements.",
    "Rediseñé plataformas existentes, con foco en experiencia de usuario y consistencia visual.": "Redesigned existing platforms, focusing on user experience and visual consistency.",
    "Realicé pruebas de usabilidad y ajustes iterativos sobre productos digitales.": "Conducted usability testing and iterative improvements to digital products.",
    "Diseñé páginas institucionales y materiales visuales para fortalecer la presencia digital.": "Designed institutional websites and visual materials to strengthen digital presence.",
    "Diseñé wireframes, maquetas e íconos para aplicaciones web internas.": "Designed wireframes, mockups, and icons for internal web applications.",
    "Relevé necesidades de clientes internos y ajusté soluciones según feedback de usuarios y áreas operativas.": "Gathered internal client needs and adapted solutions based on feedback from users and operational teams.",
    "Diseñé comunicación interna, materiales gráficos, campañas corporativas y piezas para Recursos Humanos.": "Designed internal communications, graphic materials, corporate campaigns, and Human Resources assets.",
    "UX/UI Design, Product Design, Design Thinking y User-Centered Design.": "UX/UI design, product design, design thinking, and user-centered design.",
