    "Wireframing, prototipado interactivo, user flows, dashboards, mobile apps y responsive design.": "Wireframing, interactive prototyping, user flows, dashboards, mobile apps, and responsive design.",
    "Creación y mantenimiento de componentes reutilizables, librerías UI y documentación de sistemas de diseño.": "Creation and maintenance of reusable components, UI libraries, and design system documentation.",
    "Pruebas de usabilidad, iteración por feedback, presentaciones a clientes y acompañamiento a Product Owner.": "Usability testing, feedback-driven iteration, client presentations, and Product Owner support.",
    "Diseño de plataformas ERP, backoffice, cotizadores, sistemas de trazabilidad y productos corporativos.": "Design of ERP platforms, back-office tools, quote calculators, tracking systems, and corporate products.",
    "UX/UI Designer con experiencia en productos web y mobile, plataformas gubernamentales, fintech, seguros y sistemas internos. Me desempeño en discovery, arquitectura de información, user flows, prototipado, sistemas de diseño y documentación funcional.": "UX/UI Designer experienced in web and mobile products, government platforms, fintech, insurance, and internal systems. My work spans discovery, information architecture, user flows, prototyping, design systems, and functional documentation.",
    "Trabajo con equipos de producto y desarrollo para transformar procesos complejos en experiencias claras, accesibles y consistentes.": "I work with product and development teams to turn complex processes into clear, accessible, and consistent experiences.",
    "Soy UX/UI Designer con +5 años de experiencia diseñando productos digitales, experiencias web y sistemas visuales para plataformas institucionales, sistemas internos, landings, dashboards, productos corporativos y proyectos propios.": "I am a UX/UI Designer with 5+ years of experience designing digital products, web experiences, and visual systems for institutional platforms, internal systems, landing pages, dashboards, corporate products, and independent projects.",
    "Trabajé en plataformas gubernamentales, sistemas internos, productos corporativos, landings, experiencias web, mobile apps y piezas de comunicación digital.": "I have worked on government platforms, internal systems, corporate products, landing pages, web experiences, mobile apps, and digital communication assets.",
